  "title": "Maple Syrup Pudding",
  "description": "An &#39;upgraded&#39; version of poor man&#39;s pudding, this tasty treat from Quebec substitutes maple syrup for brown sugar syrup. It&#39;s quick and easy.",
  "authors": [
